msgstr "Shranjevanje sprememb"

# Install
msgid ""
"To start collecting reviews you need TrustMate account. Fortunetly you can "
"create it"
msgstr ""
"Če želite začeti zbirati ocene, potrebujete račun TrustMate. Na srečo ga "
"lahko ustvarite"

msgid "within one minute. We'll use data from WooCommerce"
msgstr "v eni minuti. Uporabili bomo podatke iz WooCommerce"

msgid "to make this process very easy"
msgstr "da bo ta postopek zelo enostaven"

msgid "Company details can be updated later in TrustMate panel"
msgstr "Podrobnosti o podjetju lahko pozneje posodobite na plošči TrustMate"

msgid "By registering I accept"
msgstr "Z registracijo sprejemam"

msgid "terms of service"
msgstr "Pogoji storitve"

msgid "including consent to be contacted by TrustMate customer service"
msgstr "vključno s soglasjem za stik s službo za pomoč uporabnikom TrustMate"

msgid "I going to ask clients for review by e-mail"
msgstr "Stranke bom prosil za pregled po e-pošti"

msgid "I accept"
msgstr "Sprejemam"

msgid "the data entrustment agreement"
msgstr "Pogodba o poveritvi podatkov"

msgid "Configure invitations and widgets"
msgstr "Konfiguracija povabil in pripomočkov"

msgid "Verify form below and click \"Create TrustMate account\""
msgstr "Preverite spodnji obrazec in kliknite »Ustvari račun TrustMate«"

msgid "Account data"
msgstr "Podatki o računu"

msgid "Company registration data"
msgstr "Podatki o registraciji podjetja"

msgid "Website address"
msgstr "Naslov spletne strani"

msgid "Owner's e-mail"
msgstr "E-pošta lastnika"

msgid "Company name"
msgstr "Ime podjetja"

msgid "Street"
msgstr "Ulica"

msgid "City"
msgstr "Mesto"

msgid "Zip code"
msgstr "Poštna številka"

msgid "Country"
msgstr "Država"

msgid "Tax identification number"
msgstr "Davčna številka"

# API related messages and erros
msgid "Account created"
msgstr "Račun ustvarjen"

msgid "Please check your e-mail to set password for TrustMate account"
msgstr ""
"Prosimo, preverite svoj e-poštni naslov, da nastavite geslo za račun "
"TrustMate"

msgid "Account already exists"
msgstr "Račun že obstaja"

msgid "Invalid data sent"
msgstr "Neveljavni podatki poslani"

msgid "Unexpected error"
msgstr "Nepričakovana napaka"

msgid "Cannot create account"
msgstr "Ni mogoče ustvariti računa"

msgid "Registration address in WooCommerce Settings not complete"
msgstr "Registracijski naslov v nastavitvah WooCommerce ni dokončan"

msgid ""
"Something went wrong. Please try again or contact TrustMate customer service"
msgstr ""
"Nekaj je šlo narobe. Poskusite znova ali se obrnite na službo za pomoč "
"uporabnikom TrustMate"

msgid ""
"Widget activation failed. Please try again or contact TrustMate customer "
"service"
msgstr ""
"Aktiviranje pripomočka ni uspelo. Poskusite znova ali se obrnite na službo "
"za pomoč uporabnikom TrustMate"

# Config form
msgid ""
"Your TrustMate user code (UUID from TrustMate panel, Integration section)"
msgstr ""
"Vaša uporabniška koda TrustMate (UUID iz plošče TrustMate, razdelek "
"Integracija)"

msgid "Additional TrustMate account UUIDs per language"
msgstr "Dodatni UUID-ji računov TrustMate po jezikih"

msgid "Use this only if you have multiple TrustMate language accounts"
msgstr "To uporabljajte samo, če imate več jezikovnih računov TrustMate"

msgid "Currently we only support Polylang for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Trenutno podpiramo samo Polylang za WooCommerce"

msgid "Add another"
msgstr "Dodaj še enega"

msgid "Automatic review invitations"
msgstr "Samodejna povabila k pregledu"

msgid ""
"Enable instant company review form on thank you page - do not use with After "
"successful order status"
msgstr ""
"Omogočite takojšnji obrazec za oceno podjetja na strani zahvale - ne "
"uporabljajte s statusom Po uspešni naročili"

msgid "To quickly collect client reviews turn on automatic invitations"
msgstr "Hitro zbiranje mnenj strank Vklopite samodejna povabila"

msgid ""
"While active, script sends invitations to your customers asking for review"
msgstr "Ko je skript aktiven, pošlje povabila strankam, ki prosijo za pregled"

msgid "In TrustMate panel you can"
msgstr "Na plošči TrustMate lahko"

msgid "change invitation sending delay"
msgstr "Spreminjanje zakasnitve pošiljanja povabila"

msgid "set how many times customer is reminded to write a review"
msgstr "Nastavite, kolikokrat je stranka opomnjena, naj napiše mnenje"

msgid "adjust invitation colors to your brand"
msgstr "prilagodite barve vabil svoji blagovni znamki"

msgid "turn on and off product review invitations"
msgstr "Vklop in izklop povabil k pregledu izdelka"

msgid "and more!"
msgstr "in še več!"

msgid "Ask for permission to send invitation"
msgstr "Prošnja za dovoljenje za pošiljanje povabila"

msgid "In order to send review inviations you need customer consent"
msgstr "Če želite poslati pozive k mnenju, potrebujete soglasje stranke"

msgid ""
"If you do not collect those consents by yourself (separate checkbox or "
"proper regulations), turn this option on"
msgstr ""
"Če teh soglasij ne zbirate sami (ločeno potrditveno polje ali ustrezni "
"predpisi), vklopite to možnost"

msgid ""
"If you do not directly ask customer for consent to send invitation, we "
"suggest to extend your regulations with content from"
msgstr ""
"Če stranke ne prosite neposredno za soglasje za pošiljanje vabila, "
"predlagamo, da svoje predpise razširite z vsebino"

msgid "this file"
msgstr "Ta datoteka"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Onemogočen"

msgid "After successful order"
msgstr "Po uspešnem naročilu"

msgid "After successful payment"
msgstr "Po uspešnem plačilu"

msgid "After marked as completed"
msgstr "Po označenju kot dokončano"

# Widget configuration
msgid "Show reviews with widgets"
msgstr "Prikaz mnenj s pripomočki"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Vrsta"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Company"
msgstr "Ime podjetja"

msgid "Product"
msgstr "Izdelek"

msgid "Name"
msgstr "Ime"

msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

msgid "Show badge with shop's grade"
msgstr "Pokaži značko z oceno trgovine"

msgid "Show sliding out widget with shop's grade"
msgstr "Pokaži drsni pripomoček z oceno trgovine"

msgid "Non-invasive badge is glued to screen's edge and takes little space"
msgstr ""
"Neinvazivna značka je prilepljena na rob zaslona in zavzema malo prostora"

msgid "Click shows a modal with recent reviews"
msgstr "Klik prikaže modal z nedavnimi mnenji"

msgid "You can change display position in TrustMate panel"
msgstr "Položaj zaslona lahko spremenite na plošči TrustMate"

msgid "Why use it?"
msgstr "Zakaj ga uporabljati?"

msgid "sales increase"
msgstr "povečanje prodaje"

msgid "customers do not leave site searching for reviews"
msgstr "stranke ne zapustijo spletnega mesta in iščejo mnenja"

msgid "can boost your SEO"
msgstr "lahko poveča vaš SEO"

msgid "can make search engines show stars under your results"
msgstr "lahko iskalniki prikažejo zvezdice pod vašimi rezultati"

msgid "Show badge with products' grade"
msgstr "Pokaži značko z oceno izdelka"

msgid "Click shows a modal with recent reviews and grade distribution"
msgstr "Klik prikaže modal z nedavnimi pregledi in porazdelitvijo ocen"

msgid "Widget is a finishing touch on your product page"
msgstr "Pripomoček je zaključek na strani vašega izdelka"

msgid "product sales increase"
msgstr "povečanje prodaje izdelkov"

msgid "can boost your product SEO"
msgstr "lahko poveča SEO vašega izdelka"

msgid "can make search engines show stars under product result"
msgstr "lahko iskalniki prikažejo zvezdice pod rezultatom izdelka"

msgid "Popping up reviews"
msgstr "Pojavne ocene"

msgid ""
"Social proof widget with up to three types of popping up boxes which ensure "
"your customers about quality of your services"
msgstr ""
"Pripomoček za socialni dokaz z do tremi vrstami pojavnih polj, ki vašim "
"strankam zagotavljajo kakovost vaših storitev"

msgid ""
"Position is configurable. Thanks to unconventional images and messages they "
"are very noticable"
msgstr ""
"Položaj je nastavljiv. Zahvaljujoč nekonvencionalnim slikam in sporočilom so "
"zelo opazni"

msgid "If you want to use custom images contact us at support@trustmate.io"
msgstr ""
"Če želite uporabiti slike po meri, nas kontaktirajte na support@trustmate.io"

msgid "Boxes does not take much space and are easy way to present your reviews"
msgstr ""
"Škatle ne zavzemajo veliko prostora in so enostaven način za predstavitev "
"vaših mnenj"

msgid "Show grade and reviews on product page"
msgstr "Pokaži oceno in ocene na strani izdelka"

msgid "Remember, there are more widgets available"
msgstr "Ne pozabite, da je na voljo več pripomočkov"

msgid "You can put them on your site using wordpress HTML widgets"
msgstr ""
"Lahko jih postavite na svoje spletno mesto z uporabo wordpress HTML "
"pripomočkov"

msgid "Just copy the code from TrustMate panel widget section"
msgstr "Preprosto kopirajte kodo iz razdelka pripomočka plošče TrustMate"

msgid "Turn on"
msgstr "Vklopiti"

msgid "Click to show widget description"
msgstr "Kliknite, če želite prikazati opis pripomočka"

msgid "Widget that displays the rating and reviews"
msgstr "Widget, ki prikazuje oceno in ocene"

msgid ""
"A minimalistic widget displaying average rating next to a product "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Minimalistični widget, ki prikazuje povprečno oceno poleg opisa izdelka."

msgid "Hornet allows customers to read reviews."
msgstr "Hornet omogoča strankam branje ocen."

msgid "Simple and effective."
msgstr "Preprosto in učinkovito."

msgid ""
"Display product average rating on category pages and other product listings."
msgstr ""
"Prikažite povprečno oceno izdelka na straneh kategorij in drugih seznamih "
"izdelkov."

msgid "Create a star constellation in your product lists!"
msgstr "Ustvarite zvezdno ozvezdije na svojih seznamih izdelkov!"

msgid ""
"If it does not work automatically after enabling, it may need to be "
"configured in the TrustMate client panel."
msgstr ""
"Če po omogočanju ne deluje samodejno, ga bo morda treba konfigurirati v "
"odjemalski plošči TrustMate."

# Chupacabra
#, fuzzy
msgid "Social Proof (big box)"
msgstr "Socialni dokaz pripomočka (velika škatla)"

msgid ""
"Average rating, recent reviews and customer photos displayed on static cards "
"directly on your website."
msgstr ""
"Povprečna ocena, nedavne ocene in fotografije strank prikazane na statičnih "
"karticah neposredno na vaši spletni strani."

msgid "Neat and simple."
msgstr "Urejeno in preprosto."

msgid "Carousel - company reviews"
msgstr "Vrtiljak - ocene podjetja"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Catch your customer attention with this immersive widget!"
msgstr "Pritegnite pozornost strank s tem potopnim widgetom!"

msgid ""
"Showcase your average rating and the most recent reviews on auto-scrolling "
"tiles and make your website look even cooler!"
msgstr ""
"Pokažite svojo povprečno oceno in najnovejše ocene na samodejno drsečih "
"ploščicah in naredite svojo spletno stran še bolj kul!"

msgid "Carousel - product reviews"
msgstr "Vrtiljak - ocene izdelkov"

msgid "Attract your customer attention with this dynamic widget."
msgstr "Pritegnite pozornost strank s tem dinamičnim widgetom."

msgid ""
"Average rating, recent reviews, customer images - everything in one place!"
msgstr ""
"Povprečna ocena, nedavne ocene, fotografije strank - vse na enem mestu!"

msgid "Fits like a glove and works like a dream!"
msgstr "Pristaja kot ulito in deluje kot sanje!"

# Dodo2
msgid "Static box with rating (small / large)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Showcase your review count and average rating with this simple widget."
msgstr ""
"Pokažite število svojih ocen in povprečno oceno s tem preprostim widgetom."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"No matter if your customers want to read reviews or submit their own - "
"Dodo’s got you covered!"
msgstr ""
"Ne glede na to, ali vaše stranke želijo brati ocene ali poslati svoje - Dodo "
"vas pokriva!"

msgid "Not too little, not too much - just perfect!"
msgstr "Ne premalo, ne preveč - popolno!"

# Muskrat2
msgid "Badge with the company's rating and grades distribution (edge)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Amaze your customers with this modern, interactive widget!"
msgstr "Presenetite svoje stranke s tem sodobnim, interaktivnim widgetom!"

msgid ""
"Display your average rating and review count, showcase the most recent "
"reviews and collect new ones with just a few clicks."
msgstr ""
"Prikažite svojo povprečno oceno in število ocen, predstavite najnovejše "
"ocene in zberite nove z le nekaj kliki."

msgid "Simply and intuitively."
msgstr "Preprosto in intuitivno."

msgid "Company rating - top bar"
msgstr "Ocena podjetja - zgornja vrstica"

msgid ""
"Show off the number of reviews and display the average rating with this "
"simple widget."
msgstr ""
"Pohvalite se s številom ocen in prikažite povprečno oceno s tem preprostim "
"widgetom."

msgid ""
"Buyers will know right away that they are dealing with a trustworthy company "
"when they enter your store."
msgstr ""
"Kupci bodo takoj vedeli, da imajo opravka z zaupanja vredno podjetjem, ko "
"vstopijo v vašo trgovino."

# Alpaca
msgid "Social Proof (pop-up reviews)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Attention grabber like no other."
msgstr "Pritegne pozornost kot noben drug."

msgid ""
"Display your average rating, number of reviews and present the most recent "
"ones with this unmissable widget."
msgstr ""
"Prikažite svojo povprečno oceno, število ocen in predstavite najnovejše s "
