msgid "Let Alpaca give your website that wow factor!"
msgstr "Naj Alpaca da vaši spletni strani tisti wow faktor!"

msgid "Modular widget - product reviews, expert reviews, Q&A"
msgstr ""
"Modularni widget - ocene izdelkov, strokovne ocene, vprašanja in odgovori"

msgid "Wow your customers with this versatile, modular widget!"
msgstr "Presenetite svoje stranke s tem vsestranim, modularnim widgetom!"

msgid ""
"Average rating, results of product surveys, up to 50 recent reviews, expert "
"evaluations, and the Q&A module - Hydra has everything in one place."
msgstr ""
"Povprečna ocena, rezultati anket o izdelkih, do 50 nedavnih ocen, strokovne "
"ocene in modul vprašanj in odgovorov - Hydra ima vse na enem mestu."

msgid "Designed for those who want more."
msgstr "Zasnovano za tiste, ki želijo več."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Badge - product rating (edge)"
msgstr "Pokaži značko z oceno izdelka"

msgid "Small but mighty!"
msgstr "Majhen, a mogočen!"

msgid ""
"Bring your average rating to view and showcase the full review content by "
"expanding this little widget."
msgstr ""
"Prikažite svojo povprečno oceno in predstavite celotno vsebino ocene z "
"razširitvijo tega malega widgeta."

msgid "Sliding out widget with reviews"
msgstr "Drseči widget z ocenami"

msgid "Get your reviews noticed with this sliding widget."
msgstr "Naredite svoje ocene opazne s tem drsečim widgetom."

msgid ""
"Lemur is a perfect way to demonstrate your average rating, and when "
"expanded, also latest reviews and TrustMate-granted badges."
msgstr ""
"Lemur je odličen način za prikaz vaše povprečne ocene in ob razširitvi tudi "
"najnovejših ocen in značk, podeljenih s TrustMate."

msgid "What is not to love about it?"
msgstr "Kaj pri tem ne maram?"

# Ferret
msgid "Carousel"
msgstr "Vrtiljak"

msgid ""
"Dynamic \"carousel\" widget catches the eye of customers presenting up to "
"the last 21 reviews. You set the scrolling speed of the visible ratings "
"yourself"
msgstr ""
"Dinamični pripomoček \"vrtiljak\" pritegne pozornost strank, ki "
"predstavljajo do zadnjih 21 ocen. Hitrost drsenja vidnih ocen nastavite sami"

msgid ""
"Using the carousel you increase the attractiveness of your website to search "
"engines, e.g. Google"
msgstr ""
"Z vrtiljakom povečate privlačnost svoje spletne strani za iskalnike, npr. "
"Google"

msgid ""
"Let customers read reviews about your company without leaving your website"
msgstr ""
"Omogočite strankam, da preberejo mnenja o vašem podjetju, ne da bi zapustile "
"vaše spletno mesto"

msgid ""
"The carousel is responsive and adapts to every page view and mobile devices"
msgstr ""
"Vrtiljak je odziven in se prilagaja vsakemu ogledu strani in mobilnim "
"napravam"

msgid "Product review carousel"
msgstr "Vrtiljak za pregled izdelka"

msgid "Widget with badges"
msgstr "Widget z značkami"

msgid "Want to present TrustMate-granted awards in style?"
msgstr "Želite stilsko predstaviti nagrade, podeljene s TrustMate?"

msgid "Owl is here to help!"
msgstr "Owl je tukaj, da vam pomaga!"

# FAQ section
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "FAQ"

msgid "Can I ask only for company reviews"
msgstr "Lahko vprašam samo za ocene podjetij"

msgid ""
"Yes. You need to mark company invitation configuration as automatic and make "
"sure no product invitation configuration is marked as such"
msgstr ""
"Da. Konfiguracijo povabila podjetja označiti morate kot samodejno in se "
"prepričati, da nobena konfiguracija povabila izdelka ni označena kot taka"

msgid "Can I ask only for product reviews"
msgstr "Ali lahko vprašam samo za ocene izdelkov"

msgid ""
"Yes. You need to mark product invitation configuration as automatic and make "
"sure no company invitation configuration is marked as such"
msgstr ""
"Da. Konfiguracijo povabila k izdelku označiti morate kot samodejno in se "
"prepričati, da nobena konfiguracija povabila podjetja ni označena kot taka"

msgid ""
"Remember, for product invitations to work you need to load product feed in "
"TrustMate settings"
msgstr ""
"Ne pozabite, da morajo povabila k izdelkom delovati, morate naložiti vir "
"izdelka v nastavitvah TrustMate"

msgid "Can I ask for both company and product reviews"
msgstr "Ali lahko vprašam za ocene podjetij in izdelkov"

msgid ""
"Yes. You need to mark both company and product invitation configurations as "
"automatic"
msgstr ""
"Da. Konfiguracije povabila podjetja in izdelka morate označiti kot samodejne"

msgid ""
"Is such case we recommend configuring company invitations to send at least "
"couple days befor product"
msgstr ""
"V takem primeru priporočamo, da vabila podjetja pošljete vsaj nekaj dni pred "
"izdelkom"

msgid "Sending them together may lower conversion rate"
msgstr "Če jih pošljete skupaj, lahko znižate stopnjo konverzije"

msgid "What is UUID"
msgstr "Kaj je UUID"

msgid "UUID code is a unique identifier for your TrustMate's account"
msgstr "Koda UUID je edinstven identifikator za račun vašega TrustMate."

msgid "You will find it in <em>Integration</em> section"
msgstr "Našli ga boste v razdelku <em>Integracija</em>"

msgid "How can I add widget with grades and reviews"
msgstr "Kako lahko dodam pripomoček z ocenami in ocenami"

msgid ""
"Widget which stick to screen edge can be turned on with one click in plugin "
"configuration"
msgstr ""
"Pripomoček, ki se prilepi na rob zaslona, lahko vklopite z enim klikom v "
"konfiguraciji vtičnika"

msgid ""
"All other widget you can embed on your site using Wordpress features: "
"widgets and themes"
msgstr ""
"Vse druge pripomočke, ki jih lahko vdelate na svoje spletno mesto s "
"funkcijami Wordpress: pripomočki in teme"

msgid "When should I enable \"Ask for permission to send review invitation\""
msgstr ""
"Kdaj naj omogočim »Vprašaj za dovoljenje za pošiljanje povabila k pregledu«"

msgid ""
"Always when you do not collect such consent in previous transaction steps "
"and your rules document do not handle the issue"
msgstr ""
"Vedno, če v prejšnjih korakih transakcije ne pridobite takšnega soglasja in "
"vaš dokument s pravili ne obravnava težave."

msgid "How can I hide WooCommerce product reviews"
msgstr "Kako lahko skrijem ocene izdelkov WooCommerce"

msgid ""
"You need to turn off default WooCommerce reviews in: <em>WooCommerce → "
"Settings → Products → Enable product reviews</em>"
msgstr ""
"Privzete ocene WooCommerce morate izklopiti v: <em>WooCommerce → nastavitvah "
"→ izdelkih → omogočite ocene izdelkov</em>"

msgid "Do you support WPML?"
msgstr "Ali podpirate WPML?"

msgid ""
"Yes, but keep in mind that you need to add invitation configurations for all "
"languages you want to use in TrustMate.io panel"
msgstr ""
"Da, vendar ne pozabite, da morate dodati konfiguracije povabil za vse "
"jezike, ki jih želite uporabljati na TrustMate.io plošči"

msgid "How I can decide which on my product category is sent to TrustMate.io?"
msgstr ""
"Kako se lahko odločim, katera kategorija izdelkov bo poslana TrustMate.io?"

msgid ""
"If you use multiple categories for your product the only way is to use "
"primary category feature from Yoast SEO plugin"
msgstr ""
"Če za svoj izdelek uporabljate več kategorij, je edini način uporaba "
"funkcije primarne kategorije iz vtičnika Yoast SEO"

msgid "Widgets that will be withdrawn"
msgstr "Widgeti, ki bodo umaknjeni"

# Product category mode
msgid "Product category mode"
msgstr "Način kategorije izdelka"

msgid ""
"TrustMate requires a single category for each product. In older integration "
"versions, only one category segment was sent, and for multi-category "
"products, different segments were concatenated. This made it difficult to "
"use TrustMate features based on product categories (hints, customer "
"attributes, product polls). Using full path mode is recommended, but if you "
"already use these features, reconfiguration may be required."
msgstr ""
"TrustMate zahteva eno kategorijo za vsak izdelek. V starejših različicah "
"integracije je bil poslan le en segment kategorije; pri izdelkih v več "
"kategorijah so bili segmenti združeni. To je oteževalo uporabo funkcij "
"TrustMate po kategorijah (namigi, atributi kupca, ankete). Priporočen je "
"način polne poti; pri že uporabljenih funkcijah bo morda potrebna "
"rekonfiguracija."

msgid "Short name"
msgstr "Kratko ime"

msgid "Full path"
msgstr "Polna pot"

